tyle=\"width: 228.4pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"305\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Yes, if it progresses to type&nbsp;II or&nbsp;III</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"19\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"19\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 205.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"274\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Type&nbsp;II (cystic/solid) PPB</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 154.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"206\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">12&ndash;60&nbsp;months (31&nbsp;months)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">M</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 228.4pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"305\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Yes, ~40%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"19\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"19\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 205.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"274\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Type&nbsp;III (solid) PPB</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 154.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"206\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">18&ndash;72&nbsp;months (44&nbsp;months)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.5pt;